{"title": "Private Jet Crashes in Florida, Killing Nine Aboard", "summary": "A private jet traveling from Austin, Texas, to the Bahamas crashed on Sunday, November 1, in Palm Beach County, Florida, killing all nine people on board. Dramatic footage captured the aircraft plunging from the sky before exploding on impact near a roadway. The crash occurred about 11 kilometers away from former President Donald Trump's Mar-a-Lago residence, though he had departed the area an hour prior. The aircraft was identified as a Learjet.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "फ्लोरिडा में निजी जेट दुर्घटनाग्रस्त, नौ की मौत", "summary_hi": "रविवार, 1 नवंबर को टेक्सास के ऑस्टिन से बहामास जा रहा एक निजी जेट फ्लोरिडा के पाम बीच काउंटी में दुर्घटनाग्रस्त हो गया, जिसमें सवार सभी नौ लोगों की मौत हो गई। नाटकीय फुटेज में विमान को आसमान से गिरते और सड़क के पास विस्फोटित होते हुए कैद किया गया। यह दुर्घटना पूर्व राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प के मार-ए-लागो निवास से लगभग 11 किलोमीटर दूर हुई, हालांकि वह एक घंटे पहले ही उस क्षेत्र से निकल चुके थे। विमान की पहचान लर्नजेट के रूप में हुई है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["The sole rated outlet reporting this coverage emphasized the crash's location near a roadway and the dramatic footage of the aircraft plunging and exploding."], "center": ["Coverage from multiple centrist outlets highlighted the proximity of the crash to former President Donald Trump's Mar-a-Lago residence, noting he had left the area shortly before the incident.", "Centrist reporting also focused on the dramatic moment of the crash and the fact that all nine people on board were killed."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["इस कवरेज की रिपोर्टिंग करने वाले एकमात्र रेटेड आउटलेट ने दुर्घटना के सड़क के पास स्थित होने और विमान के गिरते और विस्फोटित होने के नाटकीय फुटेज पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["कई सेंट्रिस्ट आउटलेट्स की कवरेज ने दुर्घटना के पूर्व राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प के मार-ए-लागो निवास के करीब होने पर प्रकाश डाला, जिसमें उल्लेख किया गया कि वह घटना से कुछ समय पहले ही उस क्षेत्र से निकल चुके थे।", "सेंट्रिस्ट रिपोर्टिंग ने दुर्घटना के नाटकीय क्षण और सवार सभी नौ लोगों के मारे जाने पर भी ध्यान केंद्रित किया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": "2026-11-02T04:56:12", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/ey9xen/article71655336.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/Florida%20crash%201.png", "sources": [{"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNSFpnWklXTzg5UGhSWnc3VlRneDBPd25CLUJTbGxIWTBXTGhGVlQ5Y0pGUDJiX1JvUmtyWGJHTm5FUk9jdVZNQVNUN2xkM3JtblpKLWJsVDVzeUtfaHlERlp6RXctcmxwRlJsb01xSVIwblZFdlZTMDd5TXpsbm5XQzJtM2dHNFEtQkhDVjFsMGZfNDlsZGx3WDZqVkN1X2pPMzk2eFdCejBNTU1oWTQtREQxa3k?oc=5", "headline": "Nine killed as business jet crashes into South Florida neighbourhood", "publisher_url": "https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261101-nine-killed-as-business-jet-crashes-into-south-florida-neighbourhood", "url_kind": "publisher_verified"}, {"source": "CNN", "owner": "CNN", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE1GemN5RV8xVVBTekNoR1J2eWVSb0R2ZjVkeDdXWW5WVENuaEVVbFZlZGpRaG13TFp3UUdHWEYyODRCWXhpMlc3VnloUklmUHpJS0N3VzM2R1lIaGptTWxRX0N1ZGFEV29rZXBZRWhpM3h0dw?oc=5", "headline": "9 killed after a Learjet crashes and erupts into flames in Pam Beach County, Florida", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/videos/watch-nine-killed-as-private-jet-crashes-near-roadway-in-florida/article71655354.ece", "headline": "Watch: Nine killed as private jet crashes near roadway in Florida", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/trump-left-florida-an-hour-before-jet-crashed-11-km-away-from-mar-a-lago-12269292", "headline": "Trump Left Florida An Hour Before Jet Crashed 11 km Away Fro